'''Xurkitree''' (Japanese: '''デンジュモク''' ''Denjyumoku'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

