==Trivia==
===Origin===
*The '''Electronica''' attack is named after {{wp|electronica}}, a genre of music. The name may have been chosen in reference to {{p|Xurkitree}}'s {{t|Electric}} [[type]] and design.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Xurkitree|70}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Xurkitree|39}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

